  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "awesome-egocentric-atlas",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tUse this dataset\n\t\n\nfrom datasets import load_dataset\n\nds = load_dataset(\"cy0307/awesome-egocentric-atlas\", split=\"train\")\nprint(len(ds), \"resources\")\nprint(ds[0])\n\npapers = load_dataset(\n    \"csv\",\n    data_files=\"https://huggingface.co/datasets/cy0307/awesome-egocentric-atlas/resolve/main/awesome-egocentric-papers.csv\",\n    split=\"train\",\n)\nprint(len(papers), \"paper-linked resources\")\n\nEach row is one catalogued resource. Columns:\n\n\t\n\t\t\nColumn\nDescription\n\n\n\t\t\nname\nResource name\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/cy0307/awesome-egocentric-atlas.",
  "alternateName": [
    "cy0307/awesome-egocentric-atlas",
    "Awesome Egocentric Atlas"
  ],
  "creator": {
    "@type": "Person",
    "name": "HE CHAOYUE",
    "url": "https://huggingface.co/cy0307"
  },
